flowchart TB
    T["rate 5/s, burst 3 — the ENTIRE state is two numbers per key"]
    T --> S["_state<br/>'user:1' → [tokens 0.0, last 0.0]<br/>'user:2' → [tokens 2.0, last 0.4]"]
